    "path": "eda_xdnnfnff/iot-type-gps-multi-function-controller",
    "name": "4G物联定位控制魔盒(硬件+服务端+APP)",
    "content": "<h2><span style=\"color:#e67e23\">文字越少越有料。。。。。全套车载物联设备解决方案。</span></h2>\n<p> </p>\n<h2><strong><span style=\"color:#e03e2d\">点赞不迷路，祝您天天BF</span></strong></h2>\n<p> </p>\n<div>\n<div>\n<h2><span style=\"color:#e03e2d\">产品功能</span></h2>\n<ol>\n<li><span style=\"color:#e03e2d\"><strong>带远程控制的的物联定位模组，该方案同样适用于各类485_modbus  MQTT, TCP ,UDP 等通讯协议。</strong></span></li>\n<li><span style=\"color:#e03e2d\"><strong>带震动感知，静止自动休眠，震动自动唤醒。</strong></span></li>\n<li><span style=\"color:#e03e2d\"><strong>电源电压低于10V 将自动关闭4G通讯和GPS 供电，同时负载也将关闭，保护车载蓄电池，电压恢复自动联网并发送位置。</strong></span></li>\n<li><span style=\"color:#e03e2d\"><strong>带GPS信号丢失检测，云端数据反馈。</strong></span></li>\n<li><strong><span style=\"color:#e03e2d\">车辆控制(远程启动，远程解锁，远程断油，断电等。。。)</span></strong></li>\n<li><strong><span style=\"color:#e03e2d\">负载可控制灯光多模式(爆闪，呼吸，领航，示宽单闪，双闪等)</span></strong></li>\n<li><span style=\"text-decoration:line-through\"><strong><span style=\"color:#e03e2d;text-decoration:line-through\">可扩展CAN 协议，远程控制车辆高级功能(需协议需求分析)</span></strong></span></li>\n<li><strong><span style=\"color:#e03e2d\">相关资料整理中...... </span></strong></li>\n</ol>\n<div><span style=\"color:#e67e23;font-size:18px\">485单模块请移步至  →→   <span style=\"text-decoration:underline\"><a title=\"工业级4G远程485协议转换器\" href=\"/18511895537/gong-ye-ji-4G-485xie-yi-zhuai-hu\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">工业级4G远程485协议转换器</a></span></span></div>\n</div>\n<div> </div>\n<div>\n<h2><span style=\"color:#e67e23\">项目声明</span></h2>\n<div><span style=\"color:#e67e23\">本项目为首次公开，为本人原创项目。项目未曾在别的比赛中获奖。</span></div>\n</div>\n<div> </div>\n<div> </div>\n</div>\n<h2><span style=\"font-size:24px;color:#b96ad9\">项目参数</span></h2>\n<ul>\n<li><span style=\"font-size:14px;color:#b96ad9\"><strong>PCB：4层 板厚1.2</strong></span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-size:14px;color:#b96ad9\"><strong>尺寸：47.54mm x 59.9mm</strong></span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-size:14px;color:#b96ad9\"><strong>外壳:  3D(工程内部)</strong></span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-size:14px;color:#b96ad9\"><strong>交互方式：Windows UI + APP</strong></span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-size:14px;color:#b96ad9\"><strong>电源输入接口：6V-30V</strong></span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-size:14px;color:#b96ad9\"><strong>负载输出：4路低负载回路</strong></span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-size:14px;color:#b96ad9\"><strong>通讯方式：4G LTE </strong></span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-size:14px;color:#b96ad9\"><strong>模块亏电电流：15ma</strong></span></li>\n<li><span style=\"color:#b96ad9\"><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><strong>模块正常电流：最大80ma</strong></span></span></li>\n<li><span style=\"color:#b96ad9\"><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><strong>负载总电流：最大3.2A</strong></span></span></li>\n</ul>\n<div> </div>\n<h2><span style=\"text-decoration:underline;color:#3598db;background-color:#ffffff\">开源协议</span></h2>\n<div><span style=\"text-decoration:underline;color:#3598db;background-color:#ffffff\">本工程依据“CC-BY-NC-SA 4.0”知识共享许可协议，请勿用于商用，转载时请标明出处。</span></div>\n<div> </div>\n<div> </div>\n<div>\n<div> </div>\n</div>\n<h2><span style=\"color:#169179\">项目组成(硬件)  </span></h2>\n<ul>\n<li><span style=\"color:#169179;font-size:18px\">硬件图示</span></li>\n</ul>\n<p><img src=\"//image.lceda.cn/pullimage/OIxS7YAW5jHkDtJ8ZMIzYSoF2zEsDL9VfMh46Fld.jpeg\" alt=\"\" width=\"583\" height=\"720\" /></p>\n<p><img src=\"//image.lceda.cn/pullimage/2L2noWZW5mjB2qGYdf5ZOzLhYSF8CeNrCp5cI7HD.jpeg\" alt=\"\" width=\"600\" height=\"800\" /></p>\n<p><img src=\"//image.lceda.cn/pullimage/fYDgZF0V3H0j28a9l1r0hjD85YmhxNyzJiQ4RrW9.jpeg\" alt=\"\" width=\"600\" height=\"800\" /></p>\n<p><img src=\"//image.lceda.cn/pullimage/ZJZbX65kcjL24gH9qj50S0FvlXhgJfY6NWKBHhvk.jpeg\" alt=\"\" width=\"617\" height=\"657\" /></p>\n<p><img src=\"//image.lceda.cn/pullimage/3ce15nnDmhxsvZByEZZ07prSm8KEiGlQfqPoqEOI.jpeg\" alt=\"\" width=\"616\" height=\"606\" /></p>\n<p><img src=\"//image.lceda.cn/pullimage/PPGRfvILS94JnzBUOyIq3MbWOC0FjsPzEQrCNwZ8.jpeg\" alt=\"\" width=\"618\" height=\"650\" /></p>\n<p><img src=\"//image.lceda.cn/pullimage/BDzYyxetZZLXgcQPnBaZ83O2wOpVZTErSFS8g2Wu.jpeg\" alt=\"\" width=\"612\" height=\"545\" /></p>\n<p> </p>\n<ul>\n<li><span style=\"font-size:18px;color:#e03e2d\">硬件固件烧录</span></li>\n</ul>\n<p> </p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:16px;color:#e03e2d\">通用ESP主控下载方式，flash_download_tool</span></p>\n<p><img src=\"//image.lceda.cn/pullimage/D3S7NIyvtlS8OsIzMv1TekibwKcsSYHbF2YIajVx.jpeg\" alt=\"\" width=\"235\" height=\"220\" /><img src=\"//image.lceda.cn/pullimage/C6MetbaatAhn3Jb1taGfkgnc0tvy8sy9ANX0mFKn.jpeg\" alt=\"\" width=\"300\" height=\"467\" /></p>\n<p> </p>\n<p> </p>\n<p> </p>\n<div>\n<div>\n<h2><span style=\"color:#843fa1\">项目组成(软件) 附件提供本次所需的所有软件</span></h2>\n<p> </p>\n</div>\n</div>\n<ul>\n<li><span style=\"color:#b96ad9\"><strong><span style=\"font-size:18px\">Win服务端（已实现）</span></strong></span></li>\n</ul>\n<p> </p>\n<ol>\n<li><span style=\"color:#b96ad9\"><strong><span style=\"font-size:18px\"><span style=\"font-size:16px\">基础指令下发_OK</span></span></strong></span></li>\n<li><span style=\"color:#b96ad9\"><strong><span style=\"font-size:18px\"><span style=\"font-size:16px\">管理指令下发_OK</span></span></strong></span></li>\n<li><span style=\"color:#b96ad9\"><strong><span style=\"font-size:18px\"><span style=\"font-size:16px\">开机启动_OK</span></span></strong></span></li>\n<li><span style=\"color:#b96ad9\"><strong><span style=\"font-size:18px\"><span style=\"font-size:16px\">数据转发_OK</span></span></strong></span></li>\n<li><span style=\"color:#b96ad9\"><strong><span style=\"font-size:18px\"><span style=\"font-size:16px\">数据存档本地数据库_OK</span></span></strong></span></li>\n<li><span style=\"color:#b96ad9\"><strong><span style=\"font-size:18px\"><span style=\"font-size:16px\">功能重启记忆_OK</span></span></strong></span></li>\n</ol>\n<p><img src=\"//image.lceda.cn/pullimage/8ax6gk7PZehF8RRvBeIP9SdgpDV1Rxf5pgW1sb3t.jpeg\" alt=\"\" width=\"600\" height=\"497\" /></p>\n<div>\n<div> </div>\n</div>\n<div>\n<ul>\n<li><span style=\"color:#ba372a;font-size:18px\">移动端APP</span></li>\n</ul>\n<p> </p>\n<ol>\n<li><span style=\"color:#ba372a\">基础指令下发_OK</span></li>\n<li><span style=\"color:#ba372a\">管理指令下发_OK</span></li>\n<li><span style=\"color:#ba372a\">通讯提示音_OK</span></li>\n<li><span style=\"color:#236fa1;font-size:18px\"><span style=\"color:#ba372a\">服务器重连_OK</span></span></li>\n<li><span style=\"color:#ba372a\"><span style=\"font-size:18px\">退出确认，2次返回_OK</span></span></li>\n<li><span style=\"color:#ba372a\"><span style=\"font-size:18px\">系统设置接口调用_OK</span></span></li>\n<li><span style=\"text-decoration:line-through\"><span style=\"color:#ba372a;text-decoration:line-through\"><span style=\"font-size:18px\">蓝牙短距通讯</span></span></span></li>\n</ol>\n<p><img src=\"//image.lceda.cn/pullimage/1DQr7XyDovsL5JYxZNGaQVeseL1rScahz7ij9TaF.jpeg\" alt=\"\" width=\"800\" height=\"550\" /></p>\n</div>\n<div>\n<ul>\n<li>4G模块配置  资料整理中...</li>\n</ul>\n<p> </p>\n<p><img src=\"//image.lceda.cn/pullimage/9cQNsyzW27jp5CPk7lCT8qtNAItMDLUhKbylVTPZ.jpeg\" alt=\"\" width=\"551\" height=\"370\" /></p>\n<p> </p>\n<ul>\n<li>GPS模块配置  资料整理中...</li>\n</ul>\n</div>\n<div> </div>\n<div><img src=\"//image.lceda.cn/pullimage/8Y3KrL0rRKmFKBergtvCtaiuh2e7BWPeVh4EClgp.jpeg\" alt=\"\" width=\"552\" height=\"406\" /></div>\n<div>\n<h1><span style=\"font-size:24px\">企鹅群：754881030</span></h1>\n<p> </p>\n</div>\n<div>\n<h2><span style=\"color:#843fa1\">测试视频</span></h2>\n</div>",
    "introduction": "一款工业级物联网通用的4G 三网+GPS+远程控制的多功能魔盒。任何一部分都可单独分离拼凑出其他产品。\n产品从软到硬，不用第三方云平台，从本地到云端，移动端到云端， 各环节配套一条龙全部原创开发。",
